  "level": "- **L4**: blocking queue of connections, borrow/return.\n- **L5**: semaphore + idle deque with lazy creation, proxy with idempotent close, validation and reset, timeouts, leak detection, tests.\n- **L6**: housekeeping policies, sizing rationale, metrics, multi-target routing.",
