  "level": "- **L4**: BFS with a thread pool and a synchronized visited set.\n- **L5**: atomic claims, correct termination detection, thread count reasoning, normalisation, failure handling, deterministic tests with a fake parser.\n- **L6**: politeness per host, cancellation, distribution to many machines.",
